On 2026-03-02, Ada Norwood wrote:
> 2. Make the signage controller a pure subscriber.

No objection in principle, but the signage controller is the only thing
that knows whether the east breakwater lamps are lit, and that fact has
to reach the interlock somehow. Pure subscriber means we need a second
channel for it.

Quinn
